      "jp": "ゴミで溢れていると聞き、\n僕はその日、朝から牢屋の掃除をしていた。",
      "jp_sha256": "88b6531ee3780d6bbd6e6fc6d0eb695f3dfaf284a1028225af5b49e878f02980",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "쓰레기가 넘친다는 말을 듣고,\n나는 그날 아침부터 감옥을 청소하고 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "13561c79739c959e18fa68bd550cb9343fb030097040438226c14df5594031a0:000002_821239687468216653:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ゴミで溢れていると聞き、\n僕はその日、朝から牢屋の掃除をしていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "873ab394d45b61d136aa66931bc64eff97bcd527c6aabf3d11961dc3f3e631ac",
