      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ふぅ……すごい量のゴミですね……。",
      "jp_sha256": "e5d056b5e6d24d611bd5511a893504bbdef7495d049396a789579580dacc1cf3",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "후우…… 쓰레기가 엄청 많네요…….",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "13561c79739c959e18fa68bd550cb9343fb030097040438226c14df5594031a0:000002_821239687468216653:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ふぅ……すごい量のゴミですね……。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "f361aed2c5ffb3399f36529c642bf29362d96d61815273068c9f271d746352cb",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ほうきと塵取りでゴミを集めていく。\n狭い牢屋には酒瓶や、おつまみの残骸が散らばっていた。",
      "jp_sha256": "79dcd9c99164f09901b2fee6f6f345530f9add1830f96b350ff3e5ba0ad9ac86",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "빗자루와 쓰레받기로 쓰레기를 모은다.\n좁은 감옥에는 술병과 안주 잔해가 흩어져 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "13561c79739c959e18fa68bd550cb9343fb030097040438226c14df5594031a0:000002_821239687468216653:g0:r11",
      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ほうきと塵取りでゴミを集めていく。\n狭い牢屋には酒瓶や、おつまみの残骸が散らばっていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "921376561770c8759e163a5ce00c094a7de19d137846221172bb27d6cf43a08b",
